#: ../../source/docs/modules/vicon.rst:3 98a3ac9f9d594f07a11dd4ca12cccd79
msgid "Vicon"
msgstr "Vicon"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/vicon.rst:12 6af219a89d944b5e8320ef4a69b40c08
msgid ""
"This module connects to a Vicon motion tracking system and sends position "
"data to the UAV. For more information on how to integrate the Vicon system "
"with ArduPilot, :ref:`see here <copter:common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation>`."
msgstr ""
"此模块连接到Vicon动作捕捉系统，并向无人机发送位置数据。有关如何将Vicon系统与ArduPilot集成的更多信息，:ref:`请参见此处 "
"<copter:common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation>`。"

