#: ../../source/docs/modules/vicon.rst:30 16208474341a4cdcacee4050ef1a8e2d
msgid ""
"By default, the module will auto-detect the first object that is found by "
"the Vicon system. If you have other objects in the space that you don't want"
" to be detected, you can set the ``object_name`` parameter."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，模块会自动检测Vicon系统发现的第一个对象。如果空间内存在不希望被检测到的其他对象，可以设置 ``object_name`` 参数。"
